#16700
Credits Room-Land of the Reborn~
These aren't to replace true guild halls, just to add a place for
remorts to tweak info about their new races.
This land is to function somewhat like remort guild halls, but for
remort races.  Mainly I felt like free-form writing, so I made this place.
~
167 512 4 0 0 0 255 0
S
#16701
A Giant Archway~
   Before you stands a giant archway, reaching twenty meters above the ground
that leads into a mammoth cave.  The ground slightly slopes out from the cave.
The arches, and the pillars upon which they rest, are made of dark green
marble.  Within the cave, giant shadows can be seen moving about.    
~
