The Shore of a Hidden Reservoir  ~
   The reservoir stretches for roughly a league ahead of you.  The shore is
rocky and devoid of plant life.  The water is a deep blue clear.  A few ripples
transverse the surface of the lake.  Small mountains surround the reservoir,
cutting it off from the rest of the world.  The mountains are covered with dark
pine trees.    
