#16724
The Tranquility of Armageddon~
   A thin forceless haze whirls like a typhoon here.  Visions of pain and
suffering from all over the world cascade through the haze.  The faces of
greater demons briefly flash a demonic grin in the haze.  Howls of terror echo
through here, bringing the grim satisfaction that suffering has not subsided in
the world while you are here, resting.    
~
