droopy foliage.  The lowest branches nearly reach down to the ground.  Under
these low branches, the ground is covered in a short green grass.  The bark of
the willow's trunk is hard and grayish.  Some leaves drift down from above you
in the tree as something moves up there.  An Izarti stands guard at the base of
the tree against those that do not belong here.    
