Out on Another Branch~
   This branch is where the elder Izarti leave things for the younger Izarti to
use.  There are two branches that are perfect for holding material possessions.
The leaves on the smaller one are woven into a basket- shape, perfect for
holding potions and scrolls and other small things.  The larger branch has some
smaller branches woven together underneath it, to help it hold a great deal of
weight, such as heavy armor and weapons.    
