#16781
The Tempest~
   The world reels around you as you step through the doorway.  It feels as
though your body is being pushed and pulled in many directions at once.  
Suddenly, you appear in a room and are knocked to the ground by a horrific
roaring in your ears!  As you look about you you are buffeted by winds that rip
at your face!  For you have found the eye of the storm and that eye contains
the four elements that comprise the world of RavenMUD!    
~
