#16782
The Calm~
   A serene feeling rushes through your magical body.  You have entered the
ordered world of form and shape of the four elements.  This room is void of any
definition, yet everything seems to be perfectly in place and as it should be.
To the north is a huge chasm of nothingness.  To the south is a gigantic crop
of basalt rocks.  To the east, an intense heat can be felt and an iridescent
glow can be seen.  To the west is a large pool of water that is held in place
by a magical barricade within this room.    
~
