#16783
&14The Order of Air&00~
   Currents of strong gale winds blow in every direction.  These gales are so
strong it would literally rip any living creature apart.  However, you are an
air elemental and as each gust of wind reaches you, it gently melds into your
body.  This synergizing affect upon you creates a slight euphoric feeling.  
The chasm has no floor and any that enter this room must float within its ether
bounds.    
~
